  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/P1013683.jpg\" style=\"width: 426px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Centro de Voluntariado de Onda, en la calle San Miguel, ha acogido la tarde de este lunes un taller cer&aacute;mico navide&ntilde;o, impartido por la ceramista Joana Segura Ruiz Ha habido dos turnos, uno de las 15.30 a las 17.30 horas y otro de las 18 a las 20 horas.<br />\n </p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013683.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013684.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013685.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013686.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013687.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013688.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013689.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p1013690.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursceramicavoluntariat/p101